'''Mighty Drednot''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] and [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]] reduces time between attacks. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]], with the exception of the [[Soulstrike]] talent, which was added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]]. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]] increases health and range, decreases foreswing, time between attacks and recharge time, and adds [[Immune to Knockback|Knockback Immunity]]. They were added to [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

